# Lint and typecheck before finishing

When you finish a task that changed project source (or the user asks to clean up warnings):

1. Run `npm run lint` and `npm run typecheck` from the repo root.
2. Fix any issues in `src/**` and project config you introduced; do not edit generated files (`next-env.d.ts`, `.next/**`).
3. Re-run until both commands pass.
4. Briefly mention in the wrap-up that lint/typecheck were run and are clean (or what remains if blocked).

Do not lint build artifacts; `eslint.config.mjs` already ignores `.next/`, `node_modules/`, and `next-env.d.ts`.
